	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">While being explicit here about expectations and ethics of conduct, it is important to note that ethical behavior and principles apply not only to practitioners of Yomonsni but also to all those who participate.  </p>
